  "It required a special memory accessory!",
  "Donkey Kong 64 was the first game to require the Nintendo 64 Expansion Pak.",
  "Released in 1999 by Rare, it brought the franchise into 3D.",
  "You could control 5 different Kong characters with unique special abilities.",
  "The team originally planned a 2.5D game before switching to the Banjo engine.",
  "Up to 4 players could also compete in wild multiplayer deathmatches."
